      "updated": 1789416637430,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Whisper Dataset",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Whisper Dataset",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZvmiYZ44MZzVk2-ikYGk7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3846.305361477895,
      "y": 2710.0811868835776,
      "width": 934.6541748046875,
      "height": 1325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "RKsl7Oy5ul5JBSS_VClYy",
        "nvyxEFajcuQtpPrTtHy-8",
        "9kIfEsLQk2sTJthq2nTJb"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b32d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1714367468,
      "version": 1388,
      "versionNonce": 182250875,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789416637430,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A major reason for Whisper's robustness is not simply its architecture, but the way it was\ntrained. OpenAI constructed a very large weakly supervised dataset containing approximately\n680,000 hours of audio paired with transcripts collected from the Internet and applied a\nseries of heuristics to filter and normalize the data.\n \nThe paper does not provide a complete list of the websites or individual data sources from\nwhich this material originated. \n\nThe dataset was both multilingual and multitask. Of the 680,000 hours, around 117,000 hours\ncovered 96 non-English languages, while another substantial portion consisted of speech-to-\nEnglish translation data. \n\nThe model's training interface contains language tokens for 99 languages in total.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe models was for a total of three passes over the dataset. Due to only training for a few\nepochs, over-fitting is not a large concern, and they did not use any data augmentation or\nregularization and instead rely on the diversity contained within such a large dataset.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A major reason for Whisper's robustness is not simply its architecture, but the way it was trained. OpenAI constructed a very large weakly supervised dataset containing approximately 680,000 hours of audio paired with transcripts collected from the Internet and applied a series of heuristics to filter and normalize the data.\n \nThe paper does not provide a complete list of the websites or individual data sources from which this material originated. \n\nThe dataset was both multilingual and multitask. Of the 680,000 hours, around 117,000 hours covered 96 non-English languages, while another substantial portion consisted of speech-to-English translation data. \n\nThe model's training interface contains language tokens for 99 languages in total.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe models was for a total of three passes over the dataset. Due to only training for a few epochs, over-fitting is not a large concern, and they did not use any data augmentation or regularization and instead rely on the diversity contained within such a large dataset.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HvDH_dPtlAA4Xe7UWkGgV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3514.0550935483925,
      "y": 4114.21778748393,
      "width": 245.3090362548828,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "n06VH1Qr6VjQlPLIcqDQq",
        "repOYft3kSDE5X62e2Iah",
        "9kIfEsLQk2sTJthq2nTJb"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b32h",
